    <exercise number="441" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Miles per gallon Susana’s hybrid car gets $$45$$ miles per gallon. Her son’s truck gets $$17$$ miles per gallon. What is the difference in miles per gallon between Susana’s car and her son’s truck?</paragraph>
